						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4da992a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="4da992a" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<h2>Working With Midwest Tropical</h2><p>Backed by a talented in house team of craftsmen and designers, Midwest Tropical is a family owned business that creates one kind water features customized to our clients and their spaces. Since our founding in 1977, we’ve specialized in using a variety of <a href="/materials/">materials</a>, from glass to granite to wire mesh. That’s why you can count on us to develop the best in wire mesh water products for you. When working with us, you benefit from turnkey service that means  fast installation at your site. We serve customers throughout the United States with products fabricated in our Chicago area design facility. Our team has a long history of crafting water features and experience installing thousands of designs across the world. Let us help you re imagine and add value to your space with a custom water feature that sets the tone of elegance and beauty. To request a quote or talk to our <a href="/design-process/">design team</a> about ideas, <a href="/contact-us-2/">contact us today!</a></p>								</div>
